{"id": "70239", "title": "饮食男女", "author": "未知", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 16, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70239.htm", "intro": "灰姑娘的故事会变成真实吗？程瑞茜的答案是：不会。\n    身为妓女生下的，父不详的女孩，她早熟得忘记了如何去做梦。\n    母亲暂时依附於一个有钱的男人，可是她的生活却没有得到改善。\n    转学到贵族学校，却要处处小心，以防被排挤。\n    男人没有一个是好东西，她早就知道。\n    因为她遇到的人，在别人眼中是白马王子，在她眼中，是十足的恶魔！", "base": "files/article/html/70/70239", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "1-9", "file": "10902922.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10-18", "file": "10902923.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19-21", "file": "10902924.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1-6", "file": "10903139.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7-15", "file": "10903140.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-21", "file": "10903141.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1-6", "file": "10903142.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7-12", "file": "10903143.html", "available": false}, {"title": "最新更新", "file": "10903144.html", "available": false}, {"title": "最新更新", "file": "10903145.html", "available": false}, {"title": "最新更新", "file": "10903146.html", "available": false}, {"title": "最新更新", "file": "10903147.html", "available": false}, {"title": "最新更新", "file": "10903148.html", "available": false}, {"title": "最新更新", "file": "10903149.html", "available": false}, {"title": "最新更新", "file": "10903150.html", "available": false}, {"title": "最新更新", "file": "10903151.html", "available": false}]}